{"findings":[{"rule_id":"WPS-004","evidence":[{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D12","page":1,"quote":"⌀ 16 H7 (+0.018/0)"},{"kind":"title_block","ref":"surface_treatment","page":1,"quote":"I.Z.B.P. (TRIVALENT)"}],"comment":"The ⌀16 H7 bore carries a tight ISO fit tolerance but the part is zinc plated; plating buildup will reduce the hole diameter and cause assembly interference. The designer should add a note to mask the bore during plating or specify an undersize before plating to allow for coating thickness."

,
"recommended_correction":"Add a note specifying masking of the ⌀16 H7 bore during I.Z.B.P. plating, or provide a pre-plate machining size that accounts for the plating thickness."}]}
